# Two real clients and items, side B: a Kargan rogue (two daggers) sees the Aydor warrior of side A
# (two_items_a.voscript) spawn with sword + shield, walks over, and sees it swap to the two-handed
# axe (ENTITY_EQUIP), then leaves.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m8_two_b
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.kargan
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.2
clickon create.name
text Gozcu
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded 1800
scene expectequip main 3 off 3
waitfor world+remotes1 3600
scene expectremoteequip Kalkanli 1 2
scene markremote Kalkanli
scene walktoremote Kalkanli 3
waitfor world+moving 120
waitfor world+nodest+standing 1800
scene camera at:Kalkanli 18 5
wait 20
screenshot b01_sees_sword_shield.png
# Signal side A (it waits for us to move again), then watch it change weapons.
scene walkrel 3 0
waitfor world+moving 120
waitfor world+nodest+standing 600
scene camera at:Kalkanli 18 5
waitfor world+remoteholds6_0 3600
scene expectremoteequip Kalkanli 6 0
wait 20
screenshot b02_sees_axe.png
quit
